  description: '1 Machine monster + 1 Dinosaur monster

    Gains ATK equal to the
    original ATK of the Dinosaur monster used for its Fusion Summon. You can only
    use each of the following effects of "Dyna Tank" once per turn. When a card or
    effect is activated that targets this 1 card on the field (and no other cards)
    (Quick Effect): You can target 1 other card on the field that would be an appropriate
    target; that card or effect now targets the new target. If this card in its owner''s
    possession is destroyed by an opponent''s card: You can Special Summon 1 Dinosaur
    monster from your GY.'
